 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces raided the village of Karmel east of Yatah in southern Hebron early Tuesday and confiscated two water tankers belonging to the Al-Tuwanah village council, Shehab Wire reported. The tankers were being used to transport water from the village to Khirbet al-Halawah in Masafer Yatah when they were seized.\n\nThe drivers of the vehicles were detained during the operation.",
